---
import { BC_NS_CHECKLIST_PATH, BC_NS_COMMERCIAL_PATH } from '../data/bcNsIntegration';
---

<aside class="sp-promo bcns-article-next" aria-label="Next step after this analysis">
  <div class="sp-promo__copy">
    <p class="c-micro c-red">If this is your production</p>
    <h2 class="page-h2">These failure modes are the hiring brief</h2>
    <p class="c-lede">
      If duplicate orders, inventory drift, customer-specific pricing, or records that vanish into logs
